= Publications

Below is a selected list of my publications, mainly focusing on IoT sensing, mobile crowdsensing, intelligent sensing, and AI-enabled industrial applications.

== Selected Journal Papers

1. *Jing Zhang*, Lei Han, Bin Guo. 
   "Sparse Mobile Crowdsensing for Gas Monitoring in Coal Mine Working Face."
   /IEEE Internet of Things Journal/, 2024, 11(22): 36633--36645.
   *SCI Q1, Top Journal.*

2. *Jing Zhang*, Ke Huang, Ding Lang, Yuguang Xu, Hong-an Li, Xuewen Li.
   "Research on Multifeature Fusion False Review Detection Based on DynDistilBERT-BiLSTM-CNN."
   /IEEE Internet of Things Journal/, 2024, 11(18): 30040--30053.
   *SCI Q1, Top Journal.*

3. *Jing Zhang*, Yuqi Chen, Yao Zhang, Ruonan Xu, Bin Guo.
   "DWHA-PCMSP: Salient Object Detection Network in Coal Mine Industrial IoT."
   /IEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics/, 2025, 21(7): 5746--5754.
   *SCI Q1, Top Journal.*

4. *Jing Zhang*, Qichen Yan, Xiaogang Zhu, Keping Yu.
   "Smart Industrial IoT Empowered Crowd Sensing for Safety Monitoring in Coal Mine."
   /Digital Communications and Networks/, 2023, 9(2): 296--305.
   *ESI Highly Cited Paper, SCI Q1.*

5. *Jing Zhang*, Keping Yu, Zheng Wen, Xin Qi, Anupkumar Paul.
   "3D Reconstruction for Motion Blurred Images Using Deep Learning-Based Intelligent Systems."
   /Computers, Materials & Continua/, 2021, 66(2): 2087--2104.
   *ESI Highly Cited Paper, SCI Q2.*

6. *Jing Zhang*, Bing Li, Yao Zhang, Yuguang Xu, Hong-an Li.
   "Research on the Recommendation Method of Urban Location Point of Interest Based on DTCN-EFFN-Transformer."
   /The Journal of Supercomputing/, 2025, 81(1): 221--242.
   *SCI Q2.*

7. *Jing Zhang*, Qianqian Wang, Ding Lang, Yuguang Xu, Hong-an Li.
   "Research on User Recruitment Algorithms Based on User Trajectory Prediction with Sparse Mobile Crowd Sensing."
   /Mathematical Biosciences and Engineering/, 2023, 20(7): 11998--12023.
   *SCI Q2.*

8. *Jing Zhang*, Ting Fan, Ding Lang, Yuguang Xu, Hong-an Li.
   "Intelligent Crowd Sensing Pickpocketing Group Identification Using Remote Sensing Data for Secure Smart Cities."
   /Mathematical Biosciences and Engineering/, 2023, 20(8): 13777--13797.
   *SCI Q2.*

9. *Jing Zhang*, Xin Qi, Sanhlaing Myint, Zheng Wen.
   "Deep-Learning-Empowered 3D Reconstruction for Dehazed Images in IoT-Enhanced Smart Cities."
   /Computers, Materials & Continua/, 2021, 68(2): 2807--2824.
   *SCI Q2.*

